  "articleBodyHtml": "<h2>3D Debut Clarification</h2>\n<p>The speaker clarifies that this is not their first 3D debut, emphasizing that they have prior experience with 3D technology. This is confirmed in multiple segments, indicating a strong confidence in this claim.</p>\n<h2>Collaborative Activities and Presents</h2>\n<p>The discussion includes mentions of collaborative activities, such as playing games with presents and expressing a desire for more big collabs. The presents are described as precious and not hand-me-downs, highlighting their value and significance in the context of the activity.</p>\n<p>There is also a mention of the need for organizational tools to manage these activities, indicating a practical consideration in planning future events.</p>\n<h2>Enjoyment and Future Plans</h2>\n<p>Participants express enjoyment of the activity, comparing it to previous experiences and expressing a desire to repeat it in the future. This is supported by multiple affirmations and enthusiasm from the speakers.</p>\n<p>Future plans include seeing Shiori, who is expected to have a fully 3D body and be silly and squally, adding an element of fun and excitement to the upcoming event.</p>\n<h2>Bomi Baobab and Summery Nature</h2>\n<p>The conversation also touches on Bomi Baobab, describing them as fuzzy and sometimes cold. There is a repeated emphasis on Bomi Baobab, indicating their importance in the discussion.</p>\n<p>The summery nature of the environment is appreciated, and there is a suggestion to use sunscreen due to the weather, showing attention to comfort and safety.</p>\n<h2>記事情報</h2>\n<p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hgdJTIuZLTU</p>",
